---
import Page from "@/layouts/page.astro"
import { breadcrumbs } from "@/lib/schema"
---

<Page
  title="Reel Studio Kit Changelog"
  description="What changed in each release of Reel Studio Kit."
  path="/changelog"
  kicker="changelog"
  heading="What changed, release by release"
  jsonLd={[breadcrumbs([{ name: "Changelog", path: "/changelog" }])]}
>
  <h2>1.0</h2>
  <p>The first paid release.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Seven-stage reel workflow with a facts check and an approval gate</li>
    <li>Edge, Kokoro and own-recording voice options</li>
    <li>Local word-level caption sync with Whisper</li>
    <li>Motion system, editorial components, presets and avatars</li>
    <li>Self-review with Instagram safe zones, plus a one-command setup doctor</li>
  </ul>
</Page>
